{"title": "Artificer", "pageid": 54994, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Artificer", "categories": ["Nonexistence"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Artificer%27s_Lore\" title=\"Artificer's Lore\">Artificer's Lore</a>        </div>\n<p><b>Artificer</b> is not implemented as a playable <a href=\"/wiki/Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Class\">Class</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. There are references to artificers in game, and multiple <a href=\"/wiki/Gondians\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gondians\">Gondians</a> and members of <a href=\"/wiki/Clan_Ironhand\" title=\"Clan Ironhand\">Clan Ironhand</a> are referred to as artificers, but either have other classes<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> or no defined class.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quotes\">Quotes</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barcus_Wroot\" title=\"Barcus Wroot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png/70px-Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png/105px-Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png/140px-Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png/70px-Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">They're a clan of artificers in Baldur's Gate. I won't speak ill of their skills, but their politics are another matter entirely.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Barcus_Wroot\" title=\"Barcus Wroot\">Barcus Wroot</a>, describing clan ironhand</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/70px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/105px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/140px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/70px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Gondian artificers might lack a certain worldly wisdom, but there's no doubting they're masters of their craft.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a>, to <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes_and_references\">Notes and references</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hogi_Nuners\" title=\"Hogi Nuners\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Portrait_Hogi_Nuners.png/25px-Portrait_Hogi_Nuners.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Portrait_Hogi_Nuners.png/38px-Portrait_Hogi_Nuners.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Portrait_Hogi_Nuners.png/50px-Portrait_Hogi_Nuners.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hogi Nuners\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Portrait_Hogi_Nuners.png/25px-Portrait_Hogi_Nuners.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Portrait_Hogi_Nuners.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hogi_Nuners\" title=\"Hogi Nuners\">Hogi Nuners</a> is referred to as <code>S_WYR_Ironhand_Artificer_002</code> in game files, but is a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fighter\" title=\"Fighter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Class_Fighter_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Fighter_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Class_Fighter_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Fighter_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Class_Fighter_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Fighter_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fighter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Class_Fighter_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Fighter_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Class_Fighter_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fighter\" title=\"Fighter\">Fighter</a> </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\">